// cktImg config for sky130 decks going to xschem.
//
// .symbol_geometry = .err: xschem connects by geometry (a wire touching a pin *is* a
// connection), which is what cktImg's LINT.md says this setting is for. At the default
// .warn, margin-band feedback devices that share a centre are left on the same point
// instead of being spread apart.
.{
    .rules = .{ .symbol_geometry = .err },
}
